{"id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-partial-function.md","title":"partial-function","display":"df-partial-function — partial-function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-partial-function","aliases":["57-df-partial-function"],"display":"df-partial-function — partial-function","depends_on":["[[57-df-relation]]","[[57-df-relation-domain]]","[[57-df-range]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-partial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-partial-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-function — partial-function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71716214f566b7aa\" href=\"?note=71716214f566b7aa\" title=\"57-df-relation\">57-df-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4912637cb244efd\" href=\"?note=e4912637cb244efd\" title=\"57-df-relation-domain\">57-df-relation-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,A,B\">\\(f,A,B\\)</span> 为集合；关系、关系定义域和值域见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71716214f566b7aa\" href=\"?note=71716214f566b7aa\" title=\"57-df-relation\">57-df-relation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e4912637cb244efd\" href=\"?note=e4912637cb244efd\" title=\"57-df-relation-domain\">57-df-relation-domain</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y,z\\in B\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z),\\\\\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B),\\\\\nx\\in\\mathrm{dom}(f)&amp;\\to\\bigl(f(x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y,z\\in B\\;((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f)\\to y=z),\\\\\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B),\\\\\nx\\in\\mathrm{dom}(f)&amp;\\to\\bigl(f(x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目按第 57 册原引用处所需接口在内部补齐；背景为 ZFC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"71716214f566b7aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-relation-domain","status":"resolved","id":"e4912637cb244efd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-relation-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAn